    <li><strong>Low-Star / Positive Polarity</strong> (★1–2, polarity &gt; +0.05): Classic sarcasm signal. Users write seemingly positive text while giving low ratings — e.g., "great app, if you enjoy paying for nothing."</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="note">Methodology: Reviews with zero VADER polarity ({df[df['Sentiment_Polarity']==0.0].shape[0]:,} total, due to Unicode-styled text) are excluded from all mismatch calculations to avoid false negatives inflating apparent "clean" signal.</p>

  <div class="chart-wrap">
