    1-star reviews average 33.2 words and 2-star reviews 38.2 words, while 5-star reviews average just 24.0 words. This is consistent with motivated reasoning — users who feel wronged invest more effort articulating their grievances. The 2-star peak (38.2 words) may reflect nuanced disappointment ("it was close, but...") as distinct from pure anger.
